    "sub_name": "法人治理與人力資源管理",
    "sub_ename": "CORPORATE GOVERNANCE AND HUMAN RESOURCE MANAGEMENT",
    "describe_ch": "講授有效運用人力資源達成非營利組織目標的各種管理活動理論與實務，訓練學生瞭解非營利組織與營利組織人力資源管理之異同。講授與討論志工與職工之選、育、用、評與留等非營利人力資源管理重要課題。",
    "describe_eh": "The process of effective management of human resources for nonprofit organization and an analysis of essential relevant topics to such a process. Both volunteers and employees adequate human resource program, recruiting and selection, training and developing, motivation and welfare are major topics in this course.",
